### Requests for the IntelliJ HTTP client: click the green arrow next to each "###" block.
@checkout = http://localhost:18101

### 1. Open a checkout at a store terminal (POS) - expected 201 Created
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "storeId": "CASA-MAARIF-01",
  "channel": "POS",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "SKU-CAFE-500", "label": "Cafe moulu 500 g", "quantity": 2, "unitPriceMinor": 4590 },
    { "sku": "SKU-THE-250", "label": "The vert 250 g", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 2250 }
  ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "tok_visa_4242", "last4": "4242", "country": "MA" },
  "context": { "ipCountry": "MA", "deviceId": "POS-TERM-07" }
}

### 2. Same Idempotency-Key sent twice - first call 201, second call 200 with the same id
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-replay-001

{
  "storeId": "CASA-MAARIF-01",
  "channel": "WEB",
  "customerId": "C00042",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "SKU-CASQUE-BT", "label": "Casque Bluetooth", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 89900 }
  ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "tok_mastercard_5454", "last4": "5454", "country": "MA" },
  "context": { "ipCountry": "MA", "deviceId": "web-fp-8f2c1a" }
}

### 3. Raw card number instead of a PSP token - expected 422 (PCI-DSS rule)
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "storeId": "CASA-MAARIF-01",
  "channel": "POS",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "SKU-CAFE-500", "label": "Cafe moulu 500 g", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 4590 } ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "4111 1111 1111 1111", "last4": "1111", "country": "MA" }
}

### 4. Missing fields - expected 400 with the list of errors
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "channel": "POS",
  "currency": "mad",
  "lines": []
}

### 5. Latest checkouts
GET {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts?limit=10
